      <span class="hidden sm:block w-px h-5 bg-border/50"></span>
      <p class="text-sm lg:text-base text-muted-foreground">No extra apps. No redirects. No friction.</p>
      <span class="hidden sm:block w-px h-5 bg-border/50"></span>
      <p class="text-sm lg:text-base text-muted-foreground">From inquiry to confirmed stay in minutes.</p>
